
## Messages shown to Pacified players when they try to do violence:

# With projectiles:
pacified-cannot-throw = 我不能狠下心投掷{ THE($projectile) }，这可能伤到别人！
# With embedding projectiles:
pacified-cannot-throw-embed = 我绝不能投掷{ THE($projectile) }，它可能会扎进别人身体里！
# With liquid-spilling projectiles:
pacified-cannot-throw-spill = 我不能投掷{ THE($projectile) }，它可能把脏东西洒到别人身上！

pacified-cannot-harm-directly = 我不能狠下心伤害{ THE($entity) }！
pacified-cannot-harm-indirect = 我不能破坏{ THE($entity) }，这可能伤到别人！
pacified-cannot-fire-gun = 我不能用{ THE($entity) }开火，这可能伤到别人！
